{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03117","headline":"奉和圣制途经华山 · 张九龄","name":"奉和圣制途经华山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万乘华山下，千岩云汉中。\n灵居虽窅密，睿览忽玄同。\n日月临高掌，神仙仰大风。\n攒峯势岌岌，翊辇气雄雄。\n揆物知幽赞，铭勳表圣衷。\n会应陪玉检，来此告成功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03117.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03117","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}